title: "The War Premium Leaves the Pump: Why U.S. Gas Prices Fell in November 2026"
abstract: "A sourced analysis of the 66-cent monthly decline in U.S. gasoline in November 2026, driven by the unwinding of the war premium in crude oil, recovering Gulf supply, weak demand, seasonality, and retail pass-through."
